{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/d337bbce78f1810fec45bbe325cd2b67.poster.avif?t=1761090449\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/d337bbce78f1810fec45bbe325cd2b67.webm?t=1761090449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/d337bbce78f1810fec45bbe325cd2b67.mp4?t=1761090449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mushroom Kid's Big Grass Sword</strong> is a narrative, physics-based, precision platformer that follows <strong>Mica</strong>, a little mushroom, on a journey to rescue their village after the residents are captured by a gigantic bird. Meet Grandmashroom as she leads Mica to a mysterious temple to claim the Blade of Grass: a powerful weapon with the ability to pull Mica up ledges and over dangerous obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/7e12db24bef6bae3a192581f6b0e00bf.poster.avif?t=1761090449\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/7e12db24bef6bae3a192581f6b0e00bf.webm?t=1761090449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/7e12db24bef6bae3a192581f6b0e00bf.mp4?t=1761090449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Blade of Grass</strong> is a unique weapon that <strong>can be rotated at any angle the player desires</strong>, allowing Mica to be pulled over obstacles. Combining this with Mica's jumping and gliding abilities creates a platforming experience like no other. Mica must time his jumps and angle the blade to overcome challenges and traverse a mystical world, meeting several wacky mushrooms and growing the sword to comical lengths along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield the Blade of Grass!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master a unique move-set!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet funny characters throughout your journey!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mushrooms... lots of mushrooms...</strong>\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44\ud83c\udf44</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2734360?t=1761090449","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761090449","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761090449","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761090449","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2734380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2734360/extras/d337bbce78f1810fec45bbe325cd2b67.poster.avif?t=1761090449\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/273